# Acceptance chain (step-retrace + skip movies + AIM_ASSIST; dev verbs cheat/tp/tpem/shine 2 remain, see docs/session-2026-10-11b.md): logos -> airport boss -> Shine -> Delfino boss -> shadow Mario -> gate -> Bianco -> Bianco Shine -> save.
# Retail flow without start switches (needs SUNSHINE_DEV_AIM_ASSIST=1 for the boss part, user-approved dev switch): logos -> option map -> new game -> airport0 -> walk to the briefing trigger ->
# briefing movie -> "hear the story again?" (No) -> airport scen 1 FLUDD tutorial -> wash the M graffiti.
# Run: python tools/route.py Strict tools/routes/12_tutorial_full.dev --name <n> --seconds 340   (route.py sets WARP + RENDER_SCALE 0.25)
waitfor stage=15 dirstate=4 timeout=30000
wait frames=240
mash A period=30 until cardprog=19 timeout=4500
walkto x=1080 z=-1000 radius=20 timeout=3000
mash A period=24 until cardprog=27 timeout=4500
mash A period=30 until stage=0 timeout=12000
